# Report build artefacts and personal supporting evidence.
#
# The generated report is deliberately NOT committed: it embeds a signed letter of support
# carrying a third party's name, signature, stamp and direct contact details, and this
# repository is public. The build scripts and the app screenshots (test data only) ARE
# committed, so the document regenerates on any machine that holds the letter locally.
docs/report/screenshots/letter of recommendation.jpeg
